+1. Layer 0 passed: Linux watchdog (`drv/wdt`) and the chainload BOOT image
+   (uniLoader -> U-Boot with the bring-up Linux as watchdog fallback,
+   uniLoader `drv/chainload` + U-Boot `drv/chainload`). In particular the
+   chainload test "U-Boot `fallback` comes back to the bring-up console
+   without touching the device" must have passed: every step below relies
+   on it.
+2. Host build done: `contrib/samsung-gtactive3wifi/build-image.sh` (phosh).
+
+Steps (lead; device steps through `flock build/tab.lock`):
+
+1. HOST, kernel sanity. `grep -x 'CONFIG_INITRAMFS_SOURCE=""' build/wt/duranium-out/.config`
